    "text": "class Solution {\npublic:\n    int maxSubArray(vector<int>& nums) {\n        int res = INT_MIN;                                       // 初始化为最小可能值\n        for (int i = 0, last = 0; i < nums.size(); i ++ ) {\n            last = nums[i] + max(last, 0);\n            res = max(res, last);\n        }\n        return res;\n    }\n};",
